    // genuinely separate entry point from handleCollectorChat (does not
    // call it, has its own AOCL preflight above) — the chat-dispatch-has-
    // multiple-paths history means it needs its own explicit check, not an
    // assumption it inherits one. Checked before any SSE frame is written,
    // same "plain HTTP error, not a partial SSE response" posture as the
    // AOCL gates immediately above.
